==Turkish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|tr|ota|سلمك|tr=silmek||to wipe, wash and scrub, rub off or out}}, from {{inh|tr|trk-pro|*sīl-||to wipe, rub}}.<ref>{{R:tut-pro:SDM|*sīl-|url=http://starling.rinet.ru/cgi-bin/response.cgi?single=1&basename=%2fdata%2falt%2fturcet&text_number=+723&root=config}}</ref>
{{rel-top|cognates}}
Cognate with {{cog|oui||tr=sil-||to rub}}, {{cog|xqa||tr=sil-||to wipe}}, {{cog|az|silmək||to wipe, erase}}, {{cog|ba|һылау||to smear}}, {{cog|cv|шӑлма||to sweep, wipe, rub}}, {{cog|kk|сылау||to smear, coat}}, {{cog|ky|сылоо}}, {{cog|alt|сил-|t=to rub off}}, {{cog|tk|sylmak|sɨ̄lmak|t=to wipe}}, {{cog|tyv|силиир||to become clean}}, {{cog|uz|silamoq||to press, massage}}.
{{rel-bottom}}

